  note         = {Dietary copper deficiency significantly increased mast-cell numbers in rat cremaster muscle (78 vs 51 cells/section) but did not change per-cell histamine content or degranulation sensitivity. Links copper status to mast-cell density rather than histamine content. Raw certainty 0.50, animal -> discounted 0.25.},
